OL,3,GNEWSASchools, GPs and businesses hit by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Microsoft outage, which started on
OL,8,FThursday, is still affecting services
OL,9,Fincluding Teams, Outlook and AI
OL,10,Fsoftware Copilot - here's what we know
OL,12,FA GP tells our correspondent "there
OL,13,Fwill be major problems NHS-wise";
OL,14,Fschools are reporting issues and ask
OL,15,Fparents to get in touch via phone not
OL,16,Femail; UK Parliament says "alternative
OL,17,Fcommunication arrangements are in
OL,18,Fplace"
