OL,3,GNEWSASchools, GPs and businesses hit by
OL,4,Aglobal Microsoft outage as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FHow are you affected? Ester, in
OL,8,FLancashire, says her team can't get any
OL,9,Fwork done and are asking if they can go
OL,10,Fhome. Meanwhile, Martin says it was
OL,11,F"bliss" to wake up to no emails -
OL,12,Fbefore he realised "today is a crucial
OL,13,Fday to conclude a business deal"
OL,15,FMicrosoft says it is making "additional
OL,16,Fprogress towards recovery" and says its
OL,17,Fpriority is "reducing email queues and
OL,18,Fbacklogs". Earlier, it said the issue
OL,19,Fwasn't caused by a cyber-security
OL,20,Fbreach
